   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tagus Landscape Pairs</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\n \"format\": \"sp-scheme-package\",\n \"spScheme\": \"2.0\",\n \"survey\": {\n  \"title\": \"Tagus International Nature Reserve: Landscape Pairwise Comparison (AHP)\",\n  \"description\": \"Faithful replication of Ferreira & Sánchez-Martín (2022), Land 11:68: compare six landscape photographs of the Tagus International Nature Reserve in all 15 pairs on a 1–9 preference scale (AHP), then choose a preferred landscape type without photographs.\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"landscapes\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"intro\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I agree to take part voluntarily and know I can stop at any time.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"pairs\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"custom\",\n      \"name\": \"pairwise_preference\",\n      \"title\": \"Which of the two landscapes do you prefer for outdoor / recreational activities, and how strongly?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"description\": \"15 pairwise comparisons of six landscape photographs (all pairs), in the order of the paper's Table S1. Key = <left>_<right> with A = Dehesa/Montado, B = Dehesa/Montado with stockbreeding, C = traditional olive grove, D = Mediterranean forest and scrubland, F = rural settlements, E = rivers and water bodies. Value 1–9: 1 = absolute preference for the left picture, 5 = both pictures equally preferred, 9 = absolute preference for the right picture. AHP: convert to Saaty intensities (left: 10−v, right: v−4, 5 → 1), build each respondent's or the aggregated (geometric mean) comparison matrix, take the principal eigenvector as weights and check CR < 0.1.\",\n      \"min\": 1,\n      \"max\": 9,\n      \"trials\": [\n       {\n        \"id\": \"A_B\",\n        \"left\": \"a_dehesa\",\n        \"right\": \"b_dehesa_stockbreeding\",\n        \"leftLabel\": \"Dehesa / Montado\",\n        \"rightLabel\": \"Dehesa / Montado with stockbreeding\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"A_C\",\n        \"left\": \"a_dehesa\",\n        \"right\": \"c_olive_grove\",\n        \"leftLabel\": \"Dehesa / Montado\",\n        \"rightLabel\": \"Traditional olive grove\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"A_D\",\n        \"left\": \"a_dehesa\",\n        \"right\": \"d_forest_scrubland\",\n        \"leftLabel\": \"Dehesa / Montado\",\n        \"rightLabel\": \"Mediterranean forest and scrubland\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"A_F\",\n        \"left\": \"a_dehesa\",\n        \"right\": \"f_rural_settlements\",\n        \"leftLabel\": \"Dehesa / Montado\",\n        \"rightLabel\": \"Rural settlements\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"A_E\",\n        \"left\": \"a_dehesa\",\n        \"right\": \"e_rivers_water\",\n        \"leftLabel\": \"Dehesa / Montado\",\n        \"rightLabel\": \"Rivers and water bodies\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"B_C\",\n        \"left\": \"b_dehesa_stockbreeding\",\n        \"right\": \"c_olive_grove\",\n        \"leftLabel\": \"Dehesa / Montado with stockbreeding\",\n        \"rightLabel\": \"Traditional olive grove\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"B_D\",\n        \"left\": \"b_dehesa_stockbreeding\",\n        \"right\": \"d_forest_scrubland\",\n        \"leftLabel\": \"Dehesa / Montado with stockbreeding\",\n        \"rightLabel\": \"Mediterranean forest and scrubland\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"B_F\",\n        \"left\": \"b_dehesa_stockbreeding\",\n        \"right\": \"f_rural_settlements\",\n        \"leftLabel\": \"Dehesa / Montado with stockbreeding\",\n        \"rightLabel\": \"Rural settlements\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"B_E\",\n        \"left\": \"b_dehesa_stockbreeding\",\n        \"right\": \"e_rivers_water\",\n        \"leftLabel\": \"Dehesa / Montado with stockbreeding\",\n        \"rightLabel\": \"Rivers and water bodies\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"C_D\",\n        \"left\": \"c_olive_grove\",\n        \"right\": \"d_forest_scrubland\",\n        \"leftLabel\": \"Traditional olive grove\",\n        \"rightLabel\": \"Mediterranean forest and scrubland\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"C_F\",\n        \"left\": \"c_olive_grove\",\n        \"right\": \"f_rural_settlements\",\n        \"leftLabel\": \"Traditional olive grove\",\n        \"rightLabel\": \"Rural settlements\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"C_E\",\n        \"left\": \"c_olive_grove\",\n        \"right\": \"e_rivers_water\",\n        \"leftLabel\": \"Traditional olive grove\",\n        \"rightLabel\": \"Rivers and water bodies\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"D_F\",\n        \"left\": \"d_forest_scrubland\",\n        \"right\": \"f_rural_settlements\",\n        \"leftLabel\": \"Mediterranean forest and scrubland\",\n        \"rightLabel\": \"Rural settlements\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"D_E\",\n        \"left\": \"d_forest_scrubland\",\n        \"right\": \"e_rivers_water\",\n        \"leftLabel\": \"Mediterranean forest and scrubland\",\n        \"rightLabel\": \"Rivers and water bodies\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"F_E\",\n        \"left\": \"f_rural_settlements\",\n        \"right\": \"e_rivers_water\",\n        \"leftLabel\": \"Rural settlements\",\n        \"rightLabel\": \"Rivers and water bodies\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"nophoto\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"preferred_landscape\",\n      \"title\": \"Without looking at pictures: which type of landscape do you prefer most for tourist / outdoor recreational activities?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Dehesa / Montado\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"Dehesa / Montado with stockbreeding\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"Traditional olive grove\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 4,\n        \"text\": \"Mediterranean forest and scrubland\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 5,\n        \"text\": \"Rural settlements\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 6,\n        \"text\": \"Rivers and water bodies\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"socio\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"gender\",\n      \"title\": \"Gender\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Male\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"Female\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"inputType\": \"number\",\n      \"name\": \"age\",\n      \"title\": \"Age (years)\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"min\": 18,\n      \"max\": 110\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"study_level\",\n      \"title\": \"Study level\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Basic studies\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"Medium studies\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"Graduated\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"residence\",\n      \"title\": \"Place of residence\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Rural area\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"Urban area\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"job\",\n      \"title\": \"Job / occupation\",\n      \"isRequired\": false\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f1efe8;--card:#fff;--ink:#22201a;--muted:#635c4e;--accent:#5a6b2f;--accent-ink:#fff;--line:#dcd6c8;--warn:#b3261e}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.3rem;margin:0 0 10px}h2{font-size:1.05rem;margin:0 0 10px}\np{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink)}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}\n.q{margin-top:18px}.q>b{display:block;margin-bottom:4px}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer;background:var(--card)}\ninput[type=text],input[type=number]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:100%;max-width:320px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}\n.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px}\n.t{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.bar{height:5px;background:var(--line);border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;flex:1;margin-left:12px;max-width:260px}.bar>i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--accent)}\n.pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}\n.pair figure{margin:0;background:#e6e1d6;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden}\n.pair img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:3/2;object-fit:cover;display:block}\n.pair figcaption{font-size:.85rem;padding:6px 8px;color:var(--muted)}\n.pair figcaption b{color:var(--ink)}\n.seg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(9,1fr);gap:4px;margin-top:6px}\n.seg label{display:block;cursor:pointer}\n.seg input{position:absolute;opacity:0;pointer-events:none}\n.seg span{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:42px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;font-weight:600}\n.seg input:checked+span{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.seg input:focus-visible+span{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}\n.anch{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}\n.anch span:nth-child(2){text-align:center}.anch span:nth-child(3){text-align:right}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n@media (max-width:560px){.pair{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px}.pair figcaption{font-size:.75rem}.seg{gap:3px}.seg span{height:38px}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Photographs: Ferreira &amp; Sánchez-Martín (2022), Land 11:68, Figure 4, doi:10.3390/land11010068 (CC BY 4.0; taken in the Tagus International Nature Reserve in 2019). Used with credit for research; removed if the authors object.</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='tagus2022:';\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files={}, ans={}, done={}, SPEC=null, PAIRS=[];\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e){e.textContent=m||'';e.style.visibility='visible';}}\n  function hideErr(){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.style.visibility='hidden';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function load(k){try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY+k));}catch(e){return null;}}\n  function save(k,v){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY+k,JSON.stringify(v));}catch(e){}}\n  function q(n){return Q[n]||{};}\n  function saveAll(l,b,cb){Promise.all(l.map(function(a){return SPSite.answer(a[0],a[1]);})).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){if(b)b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}cb();});}\n  function page(html,btn,cb){\n    app.innerHTML=html+'<div style=\"margin-top:18px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">'+esc(btn||'Continue')+'</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=cb;app.onchange=hideErr;app.oninput=hideErr;\n  }\n  function next(){\n    window.scrollTo(0,0);\n    if(!ans.intro)return intro();\n    for(var i=0;i<PAIRS.length;i++){if(!done[PAIRS[i].id])return pair(PAIRS[i],i);}\n    if(!ans.nophoto)return group('nophoto','Landscape preference without photographs','Continue');\n    if(!ans.socio)return group('socio','About you','Finish');\n    finish();\n  }\n  function intro(){\n    var miss=PAIRS.some(function(t){return !files[t.left+'.jpg']||!files[t.right+'.jpg'];});\n    if(miss){app.innerHTML='<h1>Pictures missing</h1><p>Media folder landscapes must hold the six photographs (a_dehesa.jpg … f_rural_settlements.jpg).</p>';return;}\n    page('<h1>Landscapes of the Tagus International Nature Reserve</h1><p>This questionnaire is about which landscapes you prefer for outdoor and recreational (tourist) activities in the Tagus International Nature Reserve on the border of Spain and Portugal.</p><p>You will see six photographs of the area, two at a time (15 pairs). For each pair, choose a number from 1 to 9: 1 means you absolutely prefer the left picture, 9 that you absolutely prefer the right picture, and 5 that you like both equally. It takes about 5 minutes.</p>'+\n      '<div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(q('consent').title)+'</label></div>','Start',function(){\n      if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Please confirm to continue.');\n      var b=this;b.disabled=true;saveAll([['consent',true]],b,function(){ans.intro=true;save('a',ans);next();});\n    });\n  }\n  function fig(name,label,side){var f=files[name+'.jpg'];return '<figure><img alt=\"'+esc(label)+'\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"><figcaption><b>'+side+'</b></figcaption></figure>';}\n  function pair(t,i){\n    var seg='<div class=\"seg\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"Preference from left (1) to right (9)\">'+[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9].map(function(v){return '<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"score\" value=\"'+v+'\"><span>'+v+'</span></label>';}).join('')+'</div><div class=\"anch\"><span>1 = absolutely prefer left</span><span>5 = same</span><span>9 = absolutely prefer right</span></div>';\n    page('<div class=\"top\"><span class=\"t\">Pair '+(i+1)+' of '+PAIRS.length+'</span><div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:'+(100*i/PAIRS.length)+'%\"></i></div></div>'+\n      '<div class=\"card\"><h2>'+esc(q('pairwise_preference').title)+'</h2><div class=\"pair\">'+fig(t.left,t.leftLabel,'Left')+fig(t.right,t.rightLabel,'Right')+'</div>'+\n      '<div class=\"q\">'+seg+'</div></div>',i===PAIRS.length-1?'Continue':'Next pair',function(){\n      var x=app.querySelector('input[name=score]:checked');if(!x)return err('Please choose a number from 1 to 9.');\n      var b=this;b.disabled=true;\n      SPSite.answer('pairwise_preference',Number(x.value),{key:t.id,shown:[t.left+'.jpg',t.right+'.jpg']}).then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){b.disabled=false;return err(r.error);}done[t.id]=true;next();});\n    });\n  }\n  var GROUPS={nophoto:['preferred_landscape'],socio:['gender','age','study_level','residence','job']};\n  function field(n){var d=q(n);\n    if(d.type==='radiogroup')return '<div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(d.title)+'</b>'+(d.choices||[]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+n+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>';\n    return '<div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(d.title)+(d.isRequired?'':' <span style=\"font-weight:400;color:var(--muted)\">(optional)</span>')+'</b><input '+(d.inputType==='number'?'type=\"number\" inputmode=\"numeric\" min=\"'+d.min+'\" max=\"'+d.max+'\"':'type=\"text\"')+' name=\"'+n+'\"></div>';}\n  function group(g,title,btn){\n    var ns=GROUPS[g];\n    page('<h1>'+esc(title)+'</h1><div class=\"card\">'+ns.map(field).join('')+'</div>',btn,function(){\n      var l=[];\n      for(var i=0;i<ns.length;i++){var n=ns[i],d=q(n);\n        if(d.type==='radiogroup'){var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+n+'\"]:checked');if(!x)return err('Please answer: '+d.title);l.push([n,Number(x.value)]);}\n        else{var v=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+n+'\"]').value.trim();\n          if(d.inputType==='number'){var k=Number(v);if(!v||!(k>=d.min&&k<=d.max)||Math.round(k)!==k)return err('Please enter your age ('+d.min+'–'+d.max+').');l.push([n,k]);}\n          else if(v)l.push([n,v]);else if(d.isRequired)return err('Please answer: '+d.title);}}\n      var b=this;b.disabled=true;saveAll(l,b,function(){ans[g]=true;save('a',ans);next();});\n    });\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p>You compared six typical landscapes of the Tagus International Nature Reserve. In the original study with 174 local residents and visitors, the AHP weights from the photo pairs ranked rural settlements first (20.3%), followed by dehesa/montado with stockbreeding (19.3%) and dehesa/montado (18.3%); rivers and water bodies came last (11.8%). Asked without photographs, people ranked the landscapes quite differently, which is why the authors argue that no single method captures landscape preference.</p><p style=\"font-size:.82rem\">Photographs and questionnaire: Ferreira, D. I. R., &amp; Sánchez-Martín, J.-M. (2022). The Assessment of the Tourism Potential of the Tagus International Nature Reserve Landscapes. Contraposition of Methods Based on the Opinion of the Demand. Land 11:68, doi:10.3390/land11010068.</p><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');var m=r.missing||[];setTimeout(function(){m.forEach(function(x){if(x==='consent')ans.intro=false;else if(x==='pairwise_preference')done={};else if(x==='preferred_landscape')ans.nophoto=false;else ans.socio=false;});save('a',ans);next();},1800);}\n      else{var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers have been saved. You can close this window now.';}});\n  }\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    try{SPEC=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('sp-scheme').textContent).survey;}catch(e){SPEC={pages:[]};}\n    SPEC.pages.forEach(function(p){p.elements.forEach(function(e){var g=SPSite.getQuestion(e.name)||{};Q[e.name]={type:e.type,inputType:e.inputType,min:e.min,max:e.max,title:g.title||e.title,isRequired:e.isRequired,choices:(g.choices&&g.choices.length)?g.choices:e.choices};if(e.name==='pairwise_preference')PAIRS=e.trials;});});\n    (SPSite.getMedia('landscapes')||[]).forEach(function(f){files[f.name]=f;});\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};ans=load('a')||{};\n    ((a.pairwise_preference&&a.pairwise_preference.trials)||[]).forEach(function(t){if(t.key)done[t.key]=true;});\n    ans.intro=a.consent===true;ans.nophoto=a.preferred_landscape!=null;ans.socio=a.residence!=null;\n    next();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
